<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: CZECH SEV.DOLY POSTS CZK 1, 2BLN 9MO GROSS.</title>
<headline>CZECH SEV.DOLY POSTS CZK 1, 2BLN 9MO GROSS.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1996-10-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results for nine month period</p>
<p>ending September 30 (in millions of crowns).</p>
<p> Gross profit	    1,181.768	 vs	 885.029</p>
<p> Operating profit	1,064.418	 vs	 807.043</p>
<p> Production		5,644.949	 vs     4,965.955</p>
<p>Sales of own</p>
<p>products and services  5,637.600	 vs     4,913.877</p>
<p> Write offs		  966.961	 vs	 860.580</p>
<p> Assets		   15,761.136	 vs    15,191.229</p>
<p> Basic capital	   8,726.880	 vs     8,726.880</p>
<p>Note: The company's full name is Severoceske Doly a.s. It is a</p>
<p>mining company based in the northern Czech town of Chomutov.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 42-2-2423-0003</p>
</text>
